    "created_at": "2016-02-29T15:47:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-29T15:47:54Z",
    "body": "I am now pretty convinced that the correct way to achieve the desired result is not to mess with focus fixup rule one, but instead to remove the first step from https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#focus-update-steps. WDYT?\n",
